--- !u!114 &1228970724
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1228970722}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0e54a79422d42324bb089db35c6f5bbb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1621523888}
  subtitleText2: {fileID: 391391258}
  subtitleBackdrop: {fileID: 878746942}
  timer: 0
  timeToNext: 0
  textData:
  - textID: intro_01
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: Hey, you're the new worker right?
  - textID: intro_02
    displayTime: 7
    textContents: You have lots of work to do. Check the clipboard on your left for
      your tasks.
  - textID: intro_03
    displayTime: 8
    textContents: Hope you can keep up! You don't want to end up like the last person
      who sat there before you did...
  - textID: Consume Focus Pills
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: Ah, I suppose I'll feel a little better now.. Back to work it is.
  - textID: focusbarlow_01
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "I feel like I can't sit at this desk a second longer!\r\n\r"
  - textID: focusbarlow_02
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "I just can't pay attention to this\u2026 When can I go home?"
  - textID: focusbarmedium_01
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "I wonder if the company Wi-fi would block TouYube on this computer\u2026\r"
  - textID: focusbarmedium_02
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "I wish I could just focus a little bit more.\r"
  - textID: focusbarhigh_01
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "No distractions could slow me down today!\r \r"
  - textID: focusbarhigh_02
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "I've never felt so focused before.\r\r \r"
  - textID: overdose_01
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "One more can't hurt...\r\r\r \r"
  - textID: replenishfocus_01
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "Ah, I suppose I'll feel a little better now.. Back to work it
      is.\r\r\r \r"
  - textID: replenishfocus_02
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "Maybe now I can get back on track.\r\r\r \r"
  - textID: replenishfocus_03
    displayTime: 4
    textContents: "I feel pretty good. I should get lots of work done now, right?
      Ha ha..\r\r\r \r"
